1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,978
In this lesson, we'll build a
booking calendar from scratch.

2
00:00:03,978 --> 00:00:08,789
By the end, patients will be able to book
you online, only at the times you choose,

3
00:00:08,789 --> 00:00:11,165
with breathing room between appointments.

4
00:00:12,021 --> 00:00:16,342
Bloom Dental wants patients to
book emergency appointments online.

5
00:00:16,342 --> 00:00:19,223
In Calendar Settings,
click Create Calendar.

6
00:00:19,223 --> 00:00:23,478
Emergencies are always seen by
Sarah, so choose Personal Booking,

7
00:00:23,478 --> 00:00:24,722
and click Continue.

8
00:00:25,572 --> 00:00:26,965
Start with the details.

9
00:00:26,965 --> 00:00:30,661
Give the calendar a clear name,
because patients will see it.

10
00:00:30,661 --> 00:00:34,236
Kyntlo builds the booking link
from the name automatically,

11
00:00:34,236 --> 00:00:36,356
and you can shorten it if you like.

12
00:00:36,356 --> 00:00:39,991
Then add a short description,
so people know what to expect.

13
00:00:40,843 --> 00:00:43,558
Next, choose who this calendar books with.

14
00:00:43,558 --> 00:00:44,398
That's Sarah.

15
00:00:44,398 --> 00:00:46,337
Then set the meeting location.

16
00:00:46,337 --> 00:00:51,573
Ours is in person at the practice, and
the address is added to every confirmation

17
00:00:51,573 --> 00:00:52,865
and calendar invite.

18
00:00:53,714 --> 00:00:55,924
Now open the Availability tab.

19
00:00:55,924 --> 00:00:57,986
First, the meeting duration.

20
00:00:57,986 --> 00:01:00,859
Emergency appointments take 30 minutes.

21
00:01:00,859 --> 00:01:05,646
The slot interval controls how
often a new start time is offered.

22
00:01:05,646 --> 00:01:08,445
Every 30 minutes keeps the diary tidy.

23
00:01:09,297 --> 00:01:11,849
Below that are your weekly working hours.

24
00:01:11,849 --> 00:01:14,650
Switch each day on or
off, and set the times.

25
00:01:14,650 --> 00:01:19,691
Let's switch on Saturday mornings too,
because toothache doesn't wait for Monday.

26
00:01:19,691 --> 00:01:24,671
If you take a lunch break, use the plus
button to add a second time range on the

27
00:01:24,671 --> 00:01:25,231
same day.

28
00:01:26,081 --> 00:01:30,311
Date-specific hours override your
normal week for a single day.

29
00:01:30,311 --> 00:01:32,593
Bank holidays are already blocked.

30
00:01:32,593 --> 00:01:37,025
Let's add Christmas Eve as unavailable
too, so nobody can book it.

31
00:01:37,877 --> 00:01:39,530
Now the scheduling rules.

32
00:01:39,530 --> 00:01:42,968
A buffer adds breathing
room after each appointment,

33
00:01:42,968 --> 00:01:45,150
for notes and resetting the room.

34
00:01:45,150 --> 00:01:48,720
Minimum scheduling notice
stops last-minute surprises.

35
00:01:48,720 --> 00:01:51,563
For emergencies, 1
hour's notice is enough.

36
00:01:52,411 --> 00:01:55,207
Booking limits protect
the rest of your day.

37
00:01:55,207 --> 00:01:58,892
We'll allow a maximum of 4
emergency appointments per day,

38
00:01:58,892 --> 00:02:01,561
and let patients book up to 30 days ahead.

39
00:02:01,561 --> 00:02:05,755
That way, emergencies never squeeze
out your routine appointments.

40
00:02:06,605 --> 00:02:09,015
Click Save, and your calendar is live.

41
00:02:09,015 --> 00:02:13,580
Use Copy link to share the booking
page on your website, in your emails,

42
00:02:13,580 --> 00:02:15,799
or on your Google Business Profile.

43
00:02:15,799 --> 00:02:19,477
Patients only ever see times
when Sarah is genuinely free,

44
00:02:19,477 --> 00:02:22,711
because Kyntlo checks her
other appointments first.

45
00:02:23,561 --> 00:02:28,388
Click Preview to see exactly what patients
see: the calendar name, the length,

46
00:02:28,388 --> 00:02:32,905
the location, and a calendar with only
the times that are genuinely free.

47
00:02:32,905 --> 00:02:35,937
Pick a time, and they're
asked for their details.

48
00:02:36,792 --> 00:02:37,822
Here's a pro tip.

49
00:02:37,822 --> 00:02:42,368
Before you share the link, book a test
appointment yourself, on your phone.

50
00:02:42,368 --> 00:02:47,035
You'll spot a confusing name, a missing
day, or a wrong time zone in seconds,

51
00:02:47,035 --> 00:02:48,672
before a real patient does.

52
00:02:49,526 --> 00:02:51,309
Your first calendar is live!

53
00:02:51,309 --> 00:02:56,594
In the next lesson, we'll collect the right
details at booking, send confirmations,

54
00:02:56,594 --> 00:02:57,804
and take a deposit.

55
00:02:57,804 --> 00:02:58,695
See you there.
